- [ ] Task 5: Frontend — neue `badge-status`-Komponente (AC: #6)
  - [ ] Neue Standalone-Komponente `seed-a-frontend/src/app/shared/ui/badge-status/` (Muster: `shared/ui/buchungsreferenz/` — `.ts` + `.html` + `.scss` + `.spec.ts`), `input.required<'Aktiv' | 'Storniert'>()` namens `status`.
